Package: pwndrop
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: curl, golang, tar, gzip
Section: tunnel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/kgretzky/pwndrop
Description: Self-deployable HTTP file hosting service for red team payloads
 pwndrop is a self-deployable server for hosting payloads over HTTP
 and WebDAV, with a web-based admin panel and built-in LetsEncrypt
 support. Control it via a REST API from your C2 framework.
